# Test images for R0 evaluation.
#
# For our pose benchmark, organise like:
#   data/test/{person_name}/
#       front.jpg       (0°)
#       left15.jpg      (15° left)
#       left30.jpg      (30° left)
#       left45.jpg      (45° left)
#       left60.jpg      (60° left)
#       left75.jpg      (75° left)
#       profile.jpg     (90°)
#
# This structure will be used to compute:
#   - Genuine similarity at each pose angle
#   - TAR @ FAR per pose
#   - The R0 baseline table
